WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.210 --> 00:00:04.672
- Well, as you guys know, it's the
25th anniversary of "Happy Gilmore."

00:00:04.672 --> 00:00:05.760
- Good for Happy Gilmore.

00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:07.217
Oh, my God.

00:00:07.217 --> 00:00:09.980
- So what we thought we'd do, we put
together a little table read for you guys.

00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:14.210
We have Shooter played by Phil
Mickelson. Happy Gilmore played by

00:00:14.210 --> 00:00:20.030
Bryson DeChambeau. Tom Brady will be the
role of the narrator. And Aaron Rogers,

00:00:20.030 --> 00:00:22.730
maybe his most important role to date,

00:00:22.730 --> 00:00:24.720
he'll be Virginia.

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:25.970
Narrator, please.

00:00:25.970 --> 00:00:26.945
Action.

00:00:26.945 --> 00:00:29.384
- He's got similar hair
as Virginia right now.

00:00:29.384 --> 00:00:30.263
Scene.
[Reel rolling]

00:00:31.955 --> 00:00:34.725
- Golf clubhouse bar. Happy
Gilmore approaches the bar.

00:00:34.725 --> 00:00:36.871
Shooter McGavin notices Happy.

00:00:36.871 --> 00:00:39.455
Shooter turns toward the
bar and walks up to Happy.

00:00:39.455 --> 00:00:42.015
- That was quite a show
you put on there today, Gilmore.

00:00:42.015 --> 00:00:43.785
You were the talk of the tournament.

00:00:43.785 --> 00:00:45.120
- Wow, thanks a lot.

00:00:45.120 --> 00:00:47.070
- Well, you really crushed
that ball off the tee.

00:00:47.070 --> 00:00:49.440
I'll tell you what. You know,
you'd be something in one of

00:00:49.440 --> 00:00:51.094
those long drive contests.

00:00:51.094 --> 00:00:51.540
Yeah.

00:00:51.540 --> 00:00:54.300
You could probably make a very
good living, traveling around,

00:00:54.300 --> 00:00:55.974
hustling at driving ranges.

00:00:55.974 --> 00:00:58.184
- A bartender sets a martini
in front of Shooter.

00:00:58.930 --> 00:01:00.100
- Thanks, Phil.

00:01:00.100 --> 00:01:04.110
- That's, that's, you know, I know what you're
doing right now, and I don't like it.

00:01:04.110 --> 00:01:06.740
So why don't you just shut your
trap before I put my foot in it.

00:01:06.740 --> 00:01:08.730
- Happy grabs his beer and
turns back to Shooter.

00:01:08.730 --> 00:01:10.460
Shooter walks around in front of Happy.

00:01:10.460 --> 00:01:11.690
- Don't turn your back on me.

00:01:11.690 --> 00:01:12.920
Let's get one thing straight:

00:01:12.920 --> 00:01:14.000
This is Shooter's tour.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:15.440
I've worked hard my whole life.

00:01:15.440 --> 00:01:16.190
Paid my dues.

00:01:16.190 --> 00:01:17.899
And now it's Shooter's turn.

00:01:17.899 --> 00:01:20.900
And Shooter's not about to let
his reign at the top be spoiled

00:01:20.900 --> 00:01:23.150
by some freak sideshow clown.

00:01:23.150 --> 00:01:24.720
- Did you just call me a freak?

00:01:24.720 --> 00:01:27.660
I was on this tour for one
reason: money. But now I got

00:01:27.660 --> 00:01:30.310
a new reason: kicking your ass.

00:01:30.310 --> 00:01:33.140
- Well, haha. I'd like to see you try.

00:01:33.140 --> 00:01:35.805
- Happy grabs his beer bottle
and smashes it on the bar.

00:01:35.805 --> 00:01:37.515
- Let's do it then.

00:01:37.515 --> 00:01:39.074
- I meant on a golf course.

00:01:39.074 --> 00:01:42.104
- Off-camera, a woman, yells and quickly
steps between Shooter and Happy

00:01:42.104 --> 00:01:43.736
to break up the confrontation.

00:01:43.736 --> 00:01:46.205
- Hey, hey, what's going on here, huh?

00:01:46.205 --> 00:01:49.774
- Oh, I was just, um, looking for
the other half of this bottle

00:01:49.774 --> 00:01:51.365
and, uh, there's some of it.

00:01:51.365 --> 00:01:53.195
There's some, there's
some right there too.

00:01:53.195 --> 00:01:54.634
- Why don't you just put it down?

00:01:54.634 --> 00:01:55.384
- Yeah, I know.

00:01:55.384 --> 00:01:57.085
- Shooter walks away from the bar.

00:01:57.085 --> 00:01:59.765
- Just stay out of my way or you'll pay.

00:01:59.765 --> 00:02:01.744
Listen to what I say.

00:02:01.744 --> 00:02:03.960
- How about I just go eat some hay?

00:02:03.960 --> 00:02:06.470
I can make things out of
clay and lay by the bay.

00:02:06.470 --> 00:02:11.007
I just may. What do you say?

00:02:11.007 --> 00:02:14.990
- Terrible.
[Laughing]
It's terrible.

00:02:14.990 --> 00:02:16.690
- Aaron, you really brought it, man.

00:02:16.690 --> 00:02:18.950
I'll tell you what, you saved
the whole scene right there.

00:02:18.950 --> 00:02:19.980
- He did.
- It was good.

00:02:19.980 --> 00:02:21.809
- Aaron was great.

